- Sí.
186
00:26:29.254 --> 00:26:31.756
Ямар ч хамаагүй.
187
00:26:32.324 --> 00:26:36.594
- Puedo conseguirte mucho más dinero.
- No hables y no te muevas.
188
00:26:36.595 --> 00:26:38.296
Ай apretaré el gatillo.
189
00:26:41.399 --> 00:26:42.534
Хариасаа юу?
190
00:26:44.803 --> 00:26:47.005
Ямар ч би afora falles, Joder.
191
00:26:47.572 --> 00:26:48.640
Мирда.
192
00:26:52.310 --> 00:26:53.577
Хола.
193
00:26:53.578 --> 00:26:56.080
Hola, Sr. Blume.
Су alarma ha sido activada.
194
00:26:56.081 --> 00:26:59.683
